	(text "Notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.96 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a59243c-b420-518a-8de7-b3d87b7ea3d6")
	)
	(text "U1: all 12 module pins drawn (2x VIN, 2x VOUT, 4x GND, 2x VRP, EN, PG).\nVRP not used: sensor buck is fed from VBAT via F4 (decided).\nJ6/J7: 2-wire USB-C pigtails into the Pi 5 and ESP32 USB-C inputs,\nso each board's own USB-C input protection is used.\nEN/PG control: region F."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 126.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "19c77ad5-f693-5df5-9b73-fd57757c1623")
	)
	(text "ESP32 3V3 pin must not power these sensors (ESP32 powers nothing)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1ea01b65-9081-5ff1-b16e-02722572f2b9")
	)
	(text "U2 EN: per module datasheet, TBD. U2 footprint TBD (module pinout)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 259.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4857b166-6790-51c2-9829-d27e777d1e34")
	)
	(text "+6V_BEC comes only from the ESC BEC; never join a 5 V rail.\nJ5: THROTTLE_PWM = GPIO5, STEER_PWM = GPIO4,\nU1_PG and ESP_SHDN = GPIO TBD (3.3 V logic, see region F)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "50de721a-e30b-596d-b0a8-dd423cb6db34")
	)
	(text "E  Sensor 3.3 V (+3V3_SENS: LDO from +5V_SENS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "77740439-eeee-5070-8a70-549c781d3e68")
	)
	(text "U1 EN (D36V50F5): off below 1.2 V, on above 1.35 V.\nEN has a 100k pull-up to VIN inside the module (up\nto 8.4 V), so EN must NEVER go straight to an ESP32\nGPIO (8.4 V on a 3.3 V pin while the ESP32 is off\nor booting). U1 also powers the ESP32, so U1 must\nstart on its own: it stays ON by default.\nProposed: ESP_SHDN high -> Q1 pulls EN low -> U1 off.\nThis is a POWER CYCLE, not a shutdown: the ESP32 loses\npower, R4 turns Q1 off, U1 restarts and the Pi 5 and\nESP32 reboot (hard cut to the Pi). A true low-battery\ncutoff needs a latch or a VIN divider on EN (open Q13).\nR4 holds Q1 off while the ESP32 boots or is absent.\nESP_SHDN: non-strapping GPIO, no pull-up at reset.\nU1_PG: non-strapping GPIO (PG is low while VOUT ramps).\nU1_PG: open-drain, low when VOUT is >20% high or\n>10% low. Pull-up: ESP32 INPUT_PULLUP (3.3 V).\nGPIOs for U1_PG / ESP_SHDN: TBD (pins.h + README)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.96 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "801fd150-2bb8-5f9f-8bc5-603affe25b1c")
	)
	(text "1. Battery: 2S LiPo, 6.0-8.4 V (ESC LVC cuts at 6.0 V).\n   Battery and ESC use T-plug pigtails (12 AWG bare\n   ends) soldered to J1/J2 pads; pad size TBD (12 AWG\n   is 3.3 mm2, footprint is the 2.5 mm2 placeholder).\n2. All fuses and protection values TBD;\n   positions are proposals.\n3. Single common GND; star point at J1 in layout.\n4. +6V_BEC is ESC-supplied, isolated from 5 V rails.\n5. Signals are 3.3 V logic or lower.\n6. Rails are project power symbols (rc_power lib):\n   pin name = Value = net name (KiCad 7-10 safe).\n7. PWR_FLAG on VBAT_RAW, GND, VBAT, VIN_CPU,\n   VIN_SENS, LDO_IN, +6V_BEC.\n8. Net classes (kicad_pro): HighCurrent = *VBAT*, GND;\n   Power5A = +5V_CPU, *VIN_CPU;\n   Power3A = +5V_SENS, *VIN_SENS, *+6V_BEC.\n   20 A path: zones or off-board wire (open Q1).\n9. J6/J7 USB-C pigtails are 24 AWG: about 0.25 V\n   drop at 5 A over 30 cm, keep them short. The Pi 5\n   gets no USB-PD 5 A offer this way (USB ports\n   limited to 600 mA unless set in config.txt).\n10. Spec: docs/schematics/power_board_plan.md.\n    Values marked TBD are unconfirmed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.96 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "914f9700-4e14-52b1-9cd9-0ca935de5a4c")
	)
	(text "A  Battery input (2S LiPo, 6.0-8.4 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 22.86 0)
		(effects
